 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Software synthesiser (k124+k121): 44 old names reorganised into 16 archetypes (Serum, Massive, Omnisphere, Sylenth1, Diva, Pigments, Vital, Phase Plant, Surge XT family, Arturia hardware emulations as archetypes of the emulated Minimoog, Jupiter-8, DX7, CS-80, Prophet-5, ARP 2600/Oberheim, Reaktor family) plus 14 flat. Myth and Zyklop are synths and stay. Moved out: Flux Mini 2 and Flux Pro (Caelum Audio) are effects and should go to the Audio effects shelf; Spitfire LABS is now a version of the Spitfire archetype; DYSEKT and Shortcircuit XT moved to Sampler. New kinds Sampler, Orchestral sample library, Virtual piano & keys, Virtual drum instrument are sourced from Wikipedia and review roundups. Omitted because no retrieved page covered them: Synthogy Ivory II, Decent Sampler details beyond the format, Audio Imperia. Brand entries use fetched pages or owner-approved knowledge; countries left blank where unsure."
}